    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/53b3d7f506e410d42c47c598fcc16a06.avif?t=1747307325\" width=640 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Blood is a brutal 1-4 player co-op samurai action roguelike where players take on the role of ruthless samurai apes on a revenge spree against the mafia who exploited their sacred Shrine of Vermillion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shrine now demands retribution\u2014delivered by katana through swift and unrelenting violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/f2b1fe4625d4d92a01c452945fef4271.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix both <strong>online</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> with friends on the couch &amp; friends joining in from across the world, all in the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, <strong>go at it alone</strong> and see if you can get vengeance by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/d522179d1dfd6e90d8d446b5cf5f066e.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/631cdda8b49219070b6f8959aaa5e731.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/631cdda8b49219070b6f8959aaa5e731.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/631cdda8b49219070b6f8959aaa5e731.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine swift dashes, bullet deflection, brutal takedowns, and charged attacks to dispatch enemies with samurai-like precision. Unleash devastating finishers and heal by absorbing the blood of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path through procedurally crafted levels filled with challenges, secrets, and blood filled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/95550db868d26ea7f651a289d8b435d7.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, seize their weapons, and turn their firepower against them\u2014until ammo runs dry. Then throw the gun back in their face and attack with a powered up katana attack to <strong>split them in half</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood will spray, limbs will fly and enemies will crawl away screaming for mercy, but no mercy will be given...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/1de3a9924aaccba93eb9f57ea0deada5.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually striking world where industrial-era machinery blends with blood-powered technology, to find ancient chests containing shards for powerful katanas and new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each katana has its <strong>unique perk</strong> empowering different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/b1c38eb896e49cb0b0fdd922537e4c02.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/e61f7e185d178f16b452892b4f6acb90.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/e61f7e185d178f16b452892b4f6acb90.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/e61f7e185d178f16b452892b4f6acb90.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of increasingly challenging bosses that evolve in several stages while fighting them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat these formidable foes, grab their head and sacrifice it to the Shrine of Vermillion to bring back balance to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/d2c6564ee3badb6a4e0175af7bd105e2.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock World Mutations that drastically change the rules of gameplay and reward you with new Katanas by completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Blood has a challenge for everyone and something to bite your teeth into for hours and hours.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/53b3d7f506e410d42c47c598fcc16a06.avif?t=1747307325\" width=640 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Blood is a brutal 1-4 player co-op samurai action roguelike where players take on the role of ruthless samurai apes on a revenge spree against the mafia who exploited their sacred Shrine of Vermillion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shrine now demands retribution\u2014delivered by katana through swift and unrelenting violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/f2b1fe4625d4d92a01c452945fef4271.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix both <strong>online</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> with friends on the couch &amp; friends joining in from across the world, all in the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, <strong>go at it alone</strong> and see if you can get vengeance by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp