/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, seize their weapons, and turn their firepower against them\u2014until ammo runs dry. Then throw the gun back in their face and attack with a powered up katana attack to <strong>split them in half</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood will spray, limbs will fly and enemies will crawl away screaming for mercy, but no mercy will be given...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/1de3a9924aaccba93eb9f57ea0deada5.webp?t=1747307325\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.poster.avif?t=1747307325\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.webm?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually striking world where industrial-era machinery blends with blood-powered technology, to find ancient chests containing shards for powerful katanas and new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each katana has its <strong>unique perk</strong> empowering different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><