xtras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.mp4?t=1747307325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock World Mutations that drastically change the rules of gameplay and reward you with new Katanas by completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Blood has a challenge for everyone and something to bite your teeth into for hours and hours.</p>",
